<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετήορος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρω</span>) 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετέωρος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lifted off the ground,
			hanging</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δέ κ᾽ αὖτε μ. πάντα γένοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.26
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρματα] ἀΐξασκε μ.</span>
			leapt <i>high into air</i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.369
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετήορα δ᾽ αἶψ᾽ ἀνάειρε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					135
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος . . μ. αὐχένα
			χαίταις</span> with <i>high-raised</i> mane, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1366
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράων τὸ μ.</span> the
				<i>upper</i> horn, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				794
			</span></i>: 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδάοροι</span></b>  (so Stanley for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδάμαροι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				590
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>wavering, inconstant, thoughtless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετήορα θρυλίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					488
				</span></i>
			.</div>
